<title>TURKEY: Eight dead in Turkish prison riot.</title>
<headline>Eight dead in Turkish prison riot.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight people died in a riot at a Turkish prison over poor conditions and treatment, health board officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The information I have received shows that there are eight dead and 11 injured,&quot; an Istanbul health official told Reuters. The riot took place on Tuesday.</p>
